message.content:
The API returned two ads for the non-existent category `"quantum-drives"`:

```json
[
  {
    "redirectUrl": "/product/6E92ZMYYFZ",
    "text": "Solar Filter for sale. Buy two, get third one for free"
  },
  {
    "redirectUrl": "/product/6E92ZMYYFZ",
    "text": "Solar Filter for sale. Buy two, get third one for free"
  }
]
```

So, instead of an error or empty list, it returns duplicate fallback ads for the Solar Filter product.

